#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:268
msgctxt "Route117_Text_SeeWifeIfYoudLikeMeToRaiseMon"
msgid ""
"I'm the DAY-CARE MAN.\p"
"I help take care of the precious\n"
"POKéMON of TRAINERS.\p"
"If you'd like me to raise your POKéMON,\n"
"have a word with my wife.$"
msgstr ""
"我是培育屋的老爷爷。\p"
"我负责帮训练家们照顾\n"
"他们珍贵的宝可梦。\p"
"如果想让我们培育宝可梦，\n"
"就去和我老伴说吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:275
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DoYouWantEgg"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you!\p"
"We were raising your POKéMON,\n"
"and my goodness, were we surprised!\p"
"Your POKéMON had an EGG!\p"
"We don't know how it got there,\n"
"but your POKéMON had it.\p"
"You do want it, yes?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，是你啊！\p"
"我们在培育你的宝可梦时，\n"
"哎呀，真是吓了一大跳！\p"
"你的宝可梦带着一颗蛋！\p"
"我们也不知道它是从哪来的，\n"
"但它就在你的宝可梦身边。\p"
"你想要吧？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:284
msgctxt "Route117_Text_YourMonIsDoingFine"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you! Good to see you.\n"
"Your {STR_VAR_1}'s doing fine.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，是你啊！真高兴见到你。\n"
"你的{STR_VAR_1}过得很好。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:288
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IllKeepIt"
msgid ""
"Well then, I'll keep it.\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"那么，就由我收下了。\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:292
msgctxt "Route117_Text_YouHaveNoRoomForIt"
msgid ""
"You have no room for it…\n"
"Come back when you've made room.$"
msgstr ""
"你没有地方带上它……\n"
"腾出空位后再来吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:296
msgctxt "Route117_Text_ReceivedEgg"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the EGG from\n"
"the DAY-CARE MAN.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从培育屋的老爷爷\n"
"那里得到了蛋。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:300
msgctxt "Route117_Text_TakeGoodCareOfIt"
msgid "Take good care of it.$"
msgstr "要好好照顾它哦。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:303
msgctxt "Route117_Text_FriendlyWithOtherTrainersMon"
msgid ""
"By the way, about your {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"it seemed to be friendly with\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"I may even have seen it receiving\n"
"a piece of MAIL.$"
msgstr ""
"对了，你的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"好像和{STR_VAR_2}的\l"
"{STR_VAR_3}相处得很好。\p"
"我好像还看到它\n"
"收到了一封邮件。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:311
msgctxt "Route117_Text_SeeWifeIfYouWantToPickUpMon"
msgid ""
"If you want to pick up your POKéMON,\n"
"have a word with my wife.$"
msgstr ""
"如果想领回你的宝可梦，\n"
"就去和我老伴说吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:315
msgctxt "Route117_Text_YourMonsAreDoingFine"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you! Your {STR_VAR_1} and\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} are doing fine.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，是你啊！你的{STR_VAR_1}和\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}都过得很好。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:319
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IWillKeepDoYouWantIt"
msgid ""
"I really will keep it.\n"
"You do want this, yes?$"
msgstr ""
"那我可真的要收下了哦。\n"
"你是想要的吧？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:323
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_WouldYouLikeUsToRaiseAMon"
msgid ""
"I'm the DAY-CARE LADY.\p"
"We can raise POKéMON for you.\p"
"Would you like us to raise one?$"
msgstr ""
"我是培育屋的老奶奶。\p"
"我们可以帮你培育宝可梦。\p"
"要让我们帮你培育一只吗？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:328
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_WhichMonShouldWeRaise"
msgid ""
"Which POKéMON should we raise for\n"
"you?$"
msgstr ""
"要让我们培育\n"
"哪只宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:332
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_WellRaiseYourMon"
msgid ""
"Fine, we'll raise your {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"for a while.\p"
"Come back for it later.$"
msgstr ""
"好的，我们会帮你培育\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}一段时间。\p"
"之后再来领回它吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:337
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_WeCanRaiseOneMore"
msgid ""
"We can raise two of your POKéMON.\n"
"Would you like us to raise one more?$"
msgstr ""
"我们可以培育两只宝可梦。\n"
"要再让我们培育一只吗？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:341
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_HusbandWasLookingForYou"
msgid "My husband was looking for you.$"
msgstr "我老伴正在找你呢。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:344
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_FineThenComeAgain"
msgid ""
"Oh, fine, then.\n"
"Come again.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这样啊。\n"
"欢迎再来。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:348
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_NotEnoughMoney"
msgid "You don't have enough money…$"
msgstr "你的钱不够……$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:351
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_TakeOtherOneBackToo"
msgid ""
"Will you take back the other one,\n"
"too?$"
msgstr ""
"另一只也要\n"
"一起领回吗？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:355
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_ComeAgain"
msgid ""
"Fine.\n"
"Come again.$"
msgstr ""
"好的。\n"
"欢迎再来。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:359
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_GoodToSeeYou"
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you! Good to see you.\n"
"Your POKéMON can only be doing good!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，是你啊！真高兴见到你。\n"
"你的宝可梦一定过得很好！$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:363
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_YourMonHasGrownXLevels"
msgid ""
"By level, your {STR_VAR_1} has\n"
"grown by {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"你的{STR_VAR_1}的等级\n"
"提升了{STR_VAR_2}级。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:367
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_YourTeamIsFull"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON team is full.\n"
"Make room, then come see me.$"
msgstr ""
"你的队伍已经满了。\n"
"腾出空位后再来找我吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:372
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_TakeBackWhichMon"
msgid "Which POKéMON will you take back?$"
msgstr "要领回哪只宝可梦？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:375
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_ItWillCostX"
msgid ""
"If you want your {STR_VAR_1} back,\n"
"it will cost ¥{STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"如果要领回{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"需要支付{STR_VAR_2}元。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:379
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_HeresYourMon"
msgid ""
"Perfect!\n"
"Here's your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"好的！\n"
"这是你的宝可梦。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:383
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_TookBackMon"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} took back {STR_VAR_1} from\n"
"the DAY-CARE LADY.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从培育屋的老奶奶\n"
"那里领回了{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:387
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_YouHaveJustOneMon"
msgid ""
"Oh? But you have just one\n"
"POKéMON.\p"
"Come back another time.$"
msgstr ""
"哎？可是你\n"
"只有一只宝可梦啊。\p"
"下次再来吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:392
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_TakeYourMonBack"
msgid "Will you take your POKéMON back?$"
msgstr "要领回你的宝可梦吗？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:395
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_WhatWillYouBattleWith"
msgid ""
"If you leave me that POKéMON,\n"
"what will you battle with?\p"
"Come back another time.$"
msgstr ""
"如果把那只宝可梦留在我这里，\n"
"你要用什么来对战呢？\p"
"下次再来吧。$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:400
msgctxt "Text_EggHatchHuh"
msgid "Huh?$"
msgstr "咦？$"

#: data/scripts/day_care.inc:403
msgctxt "Route117_PokemonDayCare_Text_YoullBeLeftWithJustOne"
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"Now, now.\p"
"If you leave that POKéMON with\n"
"me, you'll be left with just one.\p"
"You will be better off if you catch\n"
"some more, I dare say.$"
msgstr ""
"咦？\n"
"哎呀呀。\p"
"如果把那只宝可梦留在我这里，\n"
"你身边就只剩下一只了。\p"
"我看你最好\n"
"再多抓几只宝可梦吧。$"
